// The artwork the block samples, inlined as a data URI.
//
// A shadcn registry item carries text files only, so a .png beside the
// component would not survive `npx shadcn add` — the image has to travel as
// source. Re-encoded as JPEG at 448px square: the alpha channel of the original
// is uniformly opaque, so nothing is lost dropping it, and the mask this block
// wants is the whole square anyway.
//
// Sized to the frame rather than to the original: the canvas draws it at ~426px,
// so this is a near 1:1 draw. Every disc takes the colour of the one pixel under
// its centre, so a source much larger than the frame hands the sampler detail no
// disc can carry, and one much smaller hands it interpolated mush. Matching the
// two is what makes the mosaic read as the painting.
export const LION_SRC =
  "data:image/jpeg;base64,";
